     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I’ve taken a first crack at this. Let me know if I am barking up the right tree or not ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/Surfrdan/fcrepo/pull/new/FCREPO-3796"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/Surfrdan/fcrepo/pull/new/FCREPO-3796",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "enable the internal ID in the response by adding useInternalId=true",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "  curl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -X PUT http://localhost:8080/rest/test1 &&  curl -v  -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin http://localhost:8080/rest/test1?useInternalId=true\n*   Trying 127.0.0.1:8080...\n* Connected to localhost (127.0.0.1) port 8080 (#0)\n* Server auth using Basic with user 'fedoraAdmin'\n> GET /rest/test1?useInternalId=true HTTP/1.1\n\n<SNIP>\n<\n@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .\n@prefix fedora: <http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#> .\n@prefix ldp: <http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#> .\n\n<info:fedora/test1>  fedora:created  \"2024-01-09T17:29:16.593190Z\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> ;\n        fedora:lastModified    \"2024-01-10T15:07:46.505004Z\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> ;\n        fedora:createdBy       \"fedoraAdmin\" ;\n        fedora:lastModifiedBy  \"fedoraAdmin\" ;\n        rdf:type               ldp:BasicContainer ;\n        rdf:type               ldp:Resource ;\n        rdf:type               fedora:Resource ;\n        rdf:type               ldp:RDFSource ;\n        rdf:type               ldp:Container ;\n        rdf:type               fedora:Container .",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "codeBlock"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "vs",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": " curl  -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -X PUT http://localhost:8080/rest/test1 &&  curl -v  -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin http://localhost:8080/rest/test1\n*   Trying 127.0.0.1:8080...\n* Connected to localhost (127.0.0.1) port 8080 (#0)\n* Server auth using Basic with user 'fedoraAdmin'\n> GET /rest/test1 HTTP/1.1\n\n<SNIP>\n<\n@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .\n@prefix fedora: <http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#> .\n@prefix ldp: <http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#> .\n\n<http://localhost:8080/rest/test1>\n        fedora:created         \"2024-01-09T17:29:16.593190Z\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> ;\n        fedora:lastModified    \"2024-01-10T15:10:20.850877Z\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> ;\n        fedora:createdBy       \"fedoraAdmin\" ;\n        fedora:lastModifiedBy  \"fedoraAdmin\" ;\n        rdf:type               ldp:BasicContainer ;\n        rdf:type               ldp:Resource ;\n        rdf:type               fedora:Resource ;\n        rdf:type               ldp:RDFSource ;\n        rdf:type               ldp:Container ;\n        rdf:type               fedora:Container .",
          "type": "text"
         }
