     "body": "<p>I’ve taken a first crack at this. Let me know if I am barking up the right tree or not </p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Surfrdan/fcrepo/pull/new/FCREPO-3796\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/Surfrdan/fcrepo/pull/new/FCREPO-3796</a></p>\n\n<p>enable the internal ID in the response by adding useInternalId=true</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>  curl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -X PUT http://localhost:8080/rest/test1 &amp;&amp;  curl -v  -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin http://localhost:8080/rest/test1?useInternalId=true\n*   Trying 127.0.0.1:8080...\n* Connected to localhost (127.0.0.1) port 8080 (#0)\n* Server auth using Basic with user 'fedoraAdmin'\n&gt; GET /rest/test1?useInternalId=true HTTP/1.1\n\n&lt;SNIP&gt;\n&lt;\n@prefix rdf: &lt;http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&gt; .\n@prefix fedora: &lt;http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#&gt; .\n@prefix ldp: &lt;http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#&gt; .\n\n&lt;info:fedora/test1&gt;  fedora:created  \"2024-01-09T17:29:16.593190Z\"^^&lt;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime&gt; ;\n        fedora:lastModified    \"2024-01-10T15:07:46.505004Z\"^^&lt;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime&gt; ;\n        fedora:createdBy       \"fedoraAdmin\" ;\n        fedora:lastModifiedBy  \"fedoraAdmin\" ;\n        rdf:type               ldp:BasicContainer ;\n        rdf:type               ldp:Resource ;\n        rdf:type               fedora:Resource ;\n        rdf:type               ldp:RDFSource ;\n        rdf:type               ldp:Container ;\n        rdf:type               fedora:Container .</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<p>vs</p>\n\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre> curl  -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -X PUT http://localhost:8080/rest/test1 &amp;&amp;  curl -v  -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin http://localhost:8080/rest/test1\n*   Trying 127.0.0.1:8080...\n* Connected to localhost (127.0.0.1) port 8080 (#0)\n* Server auth using Basic with user 'fedoraAdmin'\n&gt; GET /rest/test1 HTTP/1.1\n\n&lt;SNIP&gt;\n&lt;\n@prefix rdf: &lt;http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&gt; .\n@prefix fedora: &lt;http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#&gt; .\n@prefix ldp: &lt;http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#&gt; .\n\n&lt;http://localhost:8080/rest/test1&gt;\n        fedora:created         \"2024-01-09T17:29:16.593190Z\"^^&lt;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime&gt; ;\n        fedora:lastModified    \"2024-01-10T15:10:20.850877Z\"^^&lt;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime&gt; ;\n        fedora:createdBy       \"fedoraAdmin\" ;\n        fedora:lastModifiedBy  \"fedoraAdmin\" ;\n        rdf:type               ldp:BasicContainer ;\n        rdf:type               ldp:Resource ;\n        rdf:type               fedora:Resource ;\n        rdf:type               ldp:RDFSource ;\n        rdf:type               ldp:Container ;\n        rdf:type               fedora:Container .</pre>\n</div></div>",
