  "description": "<p>RDF with subjects or objects prefixed by</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\n info:fedora\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<p>are automatically translated on retrieval such that \"info:fedora\" is replaced with the base Fedora URI.  In some cases users may want to see the internal resource identifiers instead of the translated ones.  </p>\n\n<p>The task here is to provide a means for indicating in the request that the user would like to suppress the translation behavior.  Whether this ability is accomplished by means of a query param, header, or some other means is up for discussion.</p>",
